<title>ITALY: Alleanza '96 net profit up 15.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Alleanza '96 net profit up 15.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Parent net profit	  233.4    vs    201.9</p>
<p>    Ordinary div		 150 lire (up 10 pct)</p>
<p>    Savings share div	  175 lire (up 10 pct)</p>
<p>Note - Italian life insurance group Alleanza Assicurazioni SpA, controlled by fellow Italian insurer Generali, said in a statement after a board meeting to examine the results that premium income was up 11.9 percent to 3.13 trillion lire and investments rose 21.8 percent to 16.78 trillion.</p>
<p>The board will meet to examine the consolidated 1996 balance sheet on May 12.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
